Step 1: Discover (DHCPDISCOVER)
Problem: Your laptop has no IP address yet and doesn't know where the DHCP server is.

Action: It sets its source IP to 0.0.0.0 and broadcasts a message to destination 255.255.255.255 on UDP Port 67:

"Hey! I am a new device (MAC address fe:08:7a:...). Is there a DHCP server on this network?"
